  "text": ">\nLocation:\nUltra Speaker Merge\n-\nUltra Speaker\nPrice:\nN/A\nMerge the following:\nWar Blade of Courage\nx1\nWar Blade of Power\nx1\nWar Blade of Speed\nx1\nWar Blade of Strength\nx1\nWar Blade of Wisdom\nx1\nSellback:\n0 AC\nRarity:\nChampion Rarity\nDescription:\nHammers may forge blades, but blades forge the future. The Goddess of War blesses those who face hardship and perservere in spite of it. Lore needs weapons to survive, and War needs Lore in order to have meaning.\nNotes:\nWhen equipped, this item does 30% more damage to\nChaos\n,\nDragon\n,\nElemental\n,\nHuman\n, and\nUndead\nmonsters.\nUsed to merge\nGoddess Of War Prestige Cloak\n.\nThanks to Amduscia.\nwindow['nitroAds'].createAd('wad-aqwwiki-below-content', {\n  \"refreshTime\": 30,\n  \"renderVisibleOnly\": false,\n  \"refreshVisibleOnly\": true,\n  \"sizes\": [ [ 300, 250 ] ],\n  \"report\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"wording\": \"Report Ad\",\n    \"position\": \"bottom-right\"\n  }\n  });\n0ac\n_g\nac\nanimated\nback\nbackweapon\nfreeplayer\nioda-excl\nmergeitem\nmergereward\nshopitem\nspectral\nxdmg2chaos\nxdmg2dragon\nxdmg2elemental\nxdmg2human\nxdmg2undead",
